Algorithms
----------
src/hash/siphash.ts
  SipHash-2-4, by Jean-Philippe Aumasson and Daniel J. Bernstein.
  Own implementation from the paper "SipHash: a fast short-input PRF" (2012).
  Test vectors from the reference implementation https://github.com/veorq/SipHash (CC0 / MIT).

